# Local design explorations and mockups. Deliberately untracked: Netlify
# deploys the repo root, so committing these would publish pages marked
# "LOCAL MOCKUP, not published" at nimbletech.uk/explorations/.
explorations/

# Internal working documents kept alongside the site for convenience.
# Same reason as explorations/ above: Netlify deploys the repo root, so a
# committed file here is a public URL. The claims-by-product-family
# analysis in particular lists which of our published claims do not hold
# — publishing it at nimbletech.uk/... would be the opposite of the point.
# Dated-prefix working notes, by convention:
20[0-9][0-9][0-1][0-9][0-3][0-9]*.md
